        "summary": "GitLab 18.8.0-ee supplies an exact Enterprise Edition source identity and GitLab 18.8 supplies the Developer Flow GA release line, while GitLab.com, Self-Managed and Dedicated service state, composite identity, trigger path, CI/CD runner, executor, model and approval authority remain separately scoped and unresolved at runtime.",
