          "statement": "The protected v18.8.0-ee tag pins GitLab Enterprise Edition source revision 1010a9b2b769993080ce8399fd25e77c54e1ad1c, and the dated 18.8 release page pins the Developer Flow GA milestone. Neither freezes a hosted service, runner executor, Duo CLI package, model backend or effective project configuration.",
