      "dossier": {
        "summary": "Devin is represented as a Cognition-managed rolling hosted coding-agent service with dated Devin 2.2 and API v3 milestones, two documented enterprise deployment models, unresolved service and runtime revisions, and separately scoped plan, action, child-session and desktop-QA approval boundaries.",
        "releaseContext": {
          "statement": "Cognition's release notes pin Devin 2.2 on 2026-02-24 and the v3 API primary release on 2026-02-20. Subsequent dated updates demonstrate a rolling service, so neither milestone identifies the current Brain, Devbox, model or deployment revision.",
          "sourceId": "source-devin-2-2-launch",
          "legacySource": null
        },
        "limitations": [
          "All product claims are attributed to Cognition public sources; no behavior was observed.",
          "No Devin account, service, API, session, model, Devbox, integration, tenant or outpost was installed, invoked or inspected.",
          "Devin 2.2 and API v3 are dated service and API milestones, not immutable current service builds.",
          "Enterprise Cloud and Customer Dedicated share a Cognition Cloud Brain but have different Devbox, tenant and network boundaries.",
          "The API schema establishes selectable fields and status meanings, not their effective value in any session.",
          "A service-user permission does not establish a particular session's target user, repository authority or audit attribution.",
          "Plan approval, safe-mode action approval, approval bypass and desktop-QA approval are different gates and are not collapsed.",
          "The desktop-QA approval claim is scoped to the Devin 2.2 release note and is not silently rolled forward.",
          "GitHub App permissions are publisher-declared authorization requirements, not proof that any repository action occurred.",
          "Secure Mode's stated effect does not identify a complete egress policy or prove enforcement.",
          "The compound-system description does not identify an exact model or model-serving revision.",
          "No independent evaluation passed independence, exact applicability, disclosure and public-artifact gates.",
          "No performance, correctness, quality, safety, privacy, containment or approval-enforcement conclusion is supported."
        ],
        "unknowns": [
          "The current Devin service revision, deployment timestamp and rollout cohort are unknown.",
          "The effective organization, account tier, enterprise feature flags and preview eligibility are unknown.",
          "The Enterprise Cloud or Customer Dedicated offering, region, tenant and exact deployment revision are unknown.",
          "The Brain, Devbox image, VM platform, outpost pool and session environment revisions are unknown.",
          "The exact model, provider, checkpoint, routing, system prompt and inference configuration are unknown.",
          "The session mode, origin, parent, child playbook, repository list, secrets and resumability state are unknown.",
          "The caller principal, credential type, service-user role and effective API permissions are unknown.",
          "The session attribution target, impersonation authorization and audit-log result are unknown.",
          "The plan-control setting, approver, plan content and approval event are unknown.",
          "The safe-mode policy, bypass-approval value, approved tool action and child-session inheritance are unknown.",
          "Desktop mode, QA request, QA approval, app state and recording output are unknown.",
          "The GitHub App installation, repository scope, branch protections and effective write authority are unknown.",
          "The Secure Mode setting, allowlists, network routes and residual internet access are unknown.",
          "Task completion, code quality, test results, PR acceptance, merge authority and downstream deployment were not independently verified."
        ]
      },
